{
%Docstring(signature="appended")
Configuration widget for :py:class:`QgsRasterVectorFieldRenderer`.

Holds the pair of band selectors which are specific to a raster layer,
and a :py:class:`QgsVectorFieldSettingsWidget` for the symbology itself,
which is shared with the mesh layer.

